00:11.000 --> 00:14.000
The first variable is n, the value of n is with 3.

00:14.000 --> 00:19.000
After that, I have passed the last place as 0.

00:19.000 --> 00:21.000
And after that, I have an empty string.

00:21.000 --> 00:23.000
Now I will come to my next level.

00:23.000 --> 00:27.000
As soon as my function is called to print binary strings,

00:27.000 --> 00:30.000
