00:52.000 --> 00:55.000
And my value of n will be 2.

00:55.000 --> 00:57.000
After that, I will do my work again.

00:57.000 --> 00:59.000
That is, to set 0 to the next place again.

00:59.000 --> 01:02.000
So I will come to another level in the stack frame.

01:02.000 --> 01:04.000
Now the value of n will be equal to 1.

01:04.000 --> 01:06.000
Now I have set 0 to the last place again.

01:06.000 --> 01:08.000
And my string has become 0.

01:08.000 --> 01:11.000
Now I will do one more work and call again.

01:11.000 --> 01:14.000
When the call will go, the value of n will pass 0.

01:14.000 --> 01:17.000
Because n is happening every time in my code.

01:17.000 --> 01:19.000
You will analyze that in the code,

01:19.000 --> 01:22.000
