01:24.000 --> 01:29.000
This time too, my last place is equal to 0.

01:29.000 --> 01:31.000
And this time my string is 0.

01:31.000 --> 01:34.000
Because as soon as I am sending it on the next level,

01:34.000 --> 01:36.000
