01:36.000 --> 01:39.000
But here, my base case will hit.

01:39.000 --> 01:40.000
n is equal to 0.

01:40.000 --> 01:41.000
As soon as the base case hits,

01:41.000 --> 01:42.000
what will I do?

01:42.000 --> 01:43.000
I will get the string printed.

01:43.000 --> 01:44.000
